  "caveats": [
    "The county's own reports sometimes give different totals. For FY2024/25 the County Budget Review and Outlook Paper (Oct 2025) reports 7.41B spent and 2.43B on development, against CoB's 5.65B and 1.05B. We show CoB's figures and are asking the county to explain the difference.",
    "From FY2022/23, CoB counts hospital fees (Facility Improvement Financing) as own-source revenue. Revenue before and after that change cannot be compared directly.",
    "Pending bills figures change between CoB reports for the same date. Treat them as reported figures, not a settled total.",
    "Do not add up spending across years without adjusting for unspent cash carried forward and re-budgeted the next year."
